  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 1801.03 “Certificate of compliance” means the document EC-3, dated March 2015 issued by the commission certifying approval of an application pursuant to RSA 155-D:4, IV or V.\n\nSource. #6879, eff 2-1-99, EXPIRED: 2-1-07\n\nNew. #8811, INTERIM, eff 2-2-07, EXPIRED: 8-1-07\n\nNew. #8958, eff 7-31-07, EXPIRED: 7-31-15 (formerly Puc 1801.04)\n\nNew. #10908, eff 8-8-15",
